# Whitelist .gitignore (legal guardrail, Guide 6): ignore EVERYTHING by
# default so game assets, extracted files, decompiled code, Ghidra DBs,
# or any game bytes can never be committed by accident. Only our own
# source, manifests, docs, and this file are allowed back in.
*
!*/
!*.rs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!*.md
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

# Build output is never committed (later rules win over the *.rs
# re-allow above, so generated sources under target/ stay ignored).
/target/
